---
import KakeyaLayout from "../../layouts/KakeyaLayout.astro";
---

<KakeyaLayout
  title="掛谷猜想 3D 數學教學"
  description="以六個循序步驟拆解掛谷問題，從一根單位線段開始，理解三維掛谷猜想與最新數學結果。"
  canonicalPath="/kakeya/learn"
  activeMode="learn"
>
  <article class="kakeya-page container">
    <header class="kakeya-hero">
      <div class="kakeya-hero__copy">
        <p class="kakeya-kicker">Math Learning</p>
        <h1>從一根針，到完整三維</h1>
        <p>逐步建立方向、集合、體積與維度的概念，再讀懂三維掛谷猜想真正證明了什麼。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="kakeya-stage" aria-label="數學教學 3D 展示區"></div>
    </header>
  </article>
</KakeyaLayout>
